{
  "_notes": [
    "Pirates of the Caribbean V6.00 (potc_600af/ai/as/gf, identical addresses; V4.00 and earlier",
    "differ). Upstream had no map for a POTC set.",
    "2026-11: compiled from the ROM image (README, 'Adjustments from the ROM'). The five mode",
    "champions hold counts (factory 25, 15, 10, 5, 5) and are declared as counter. A.2 shows IDs",
    "64-77; IDs 78-80 are not in the menu.",
    "current_player/current_ball 0x00032694/+1 and the status byte 0x000326C0 (player + 0x2C) from a",
    "headless game: 01 attract, 12 play, 43 ball held, 14 tilted; a cabinet game also read 39.",
    "Confirmed on a cabinet 2026-11-11 (ALP4K; two players, tilt on P1 ball 1): 1,411,270 /",
    "14,564,820 and the records matched the DMD. A saved cabinet NVRAM validates every record,",
    "including a Grand Champion earned there (CWP, 137,367,130).",
    "Confirmed again on a cabinet 2026-11-13 with the adjustments (ALP4K; two players, tilt on P1",
    "ball 1): 4,565,070 / 2,938,650, the records and the status byte (01, 12 play, 43 ball held, 14",
    "tilted) matched the DMD."
  ],
